    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>The Chennai logistics marketing playbook</h2>
            <p class="sec-sub">The specific channel + content + funnel weights we recommend for Chennai operators.</p>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-ship"></i></div><h3>Ocean freight route SEO: Chennai origin</h3><p>Dedicated route SEO for Chennai-to-Dubai / Jebel Ali / Dammam / Jeddah / Cape Town / New York / Long Beach ocean freight. Auto Ro-Ro to Middle East + Africa specific. Long-tail win because competition is thin.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></div><h3>LinkedIn ABM: Chennai auto + manufacturing TAL</h3><p>150-300 named accounts across Chennai auto (Hyundai, Ford, Renault-Nissan, TVS, Ashok Leyland), electronics (Foxconn, Samsung, Sanmina), pharma (Sun Pharma Chennai ops, Orchid Pharma). Sales Nav + InMail + Chennai + Tamil Nadu geo-filter.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-language"></i></div><h3>Tamil + English creative for local + regional catchment</h3><p>Tamil-language creative on Meta + Google for local + Tamil Nadu regional catchment. 25-40% better cost + engagement vs English-only for local courier + South India 3PL.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-location-dot"></i></div><h3>GBP per zone: T Nagar + Adyar + OMR + Guindy + Ambattur</h3><p>Separate Google Business Profile per operational sub-zone. Reviews in Tamil + English. Tap-to-call + WhatsApp CTA. High-usage channel for Chennai corporate + local couriers.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-newspaper"></i></div><h3>Auto industry publication PR</h3><p>Cargo Talk + Maritime Gateway + ITLN + Auto Component Manufacturers Association India + South India trade publications. Speaker slots at India Warehousing Show South + FIATA regional + ACMA events.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-globe"></i></div><h3>GCC + Africa + LATAM freight forwarding focus</h3><p>Chennai's natural corridors are Middle East + Africa + LATAM for auto exports. Route-specific SEO + content on India-to-Africa freight + India-to-LATAM auto Ro-Ro + India-to-GCC ocean container is category-authority-building.</p></div>
            </div>
